  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mialebouni Gari Production and Marketing Expansion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Cassava processing, Beneficiaries: 873 (816 women), Description: The group seeks to increase production of gari through expansion of the network of coentreprises of Mialebouni working with the cooperative, construction of additional production facilities and provision of equipment and training to improve productivity and quality.</narrative>
